x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}+xyz)\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}+xyz)\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}({x}^{2}+xyz)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =(2x+yz)\\text{ }i+xz\\text{ }j+xy\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇\\,f(4,2,-2) & =(2(4)+2(-2))\\text{ }i+4(-2)\\text{ }j+4(2)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =4\\,i-8j+8\\,k \\\\  & =⟨4,-8,8⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(4,2,-2)\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y-2,\\,z+2⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨4,-8,8⟩\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y-2,\\,z+2⟩ & =0 \\\\ 4(x-4)+(-8)(y-2)+8(z+2) & =0 \\\\ 4x-8y+8z+16 & =0 \\\\ x-2y+2z+4=0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368676 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368677 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368678 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368679 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1000 #edb/ref 17592186368680 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1041 "selection" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1104 #edb/ref 17592186368680 13194139535828 true] [17592186368675 1110 #uuid "0a852c8f-8672-5100-a6bf-df90456d1ce5" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368676 1034 "2x-y+z-4=0" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368676 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535828 true] [17592186368676 1111 #uuid "297e6c3f-228f-5395-bfd6-43c4eb37be64" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368677 1034 "x-2y+2z-8=0" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368677 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535828 true] [17592186368677 1111 #uuid "1d218f7b-96c2-5c2f-8db7-e63838737fe2" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368678 1034 "x-4y+z+6=0" 13194139535828 true] [17592186368678 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535828 true] [17592186368678 1111 #uuid "4efe22cf-f0ea-546a-989c-af7932619bcb" 1319413953